\ the Hurricane's windscreen in the view, faint: the armoured centre panel's frame, its two posts rising from the coaming either side of the sight, leaning in, to the top rail across them; from the rail's ends the side panes' top edges running back over the pilot's head out of the view (positions in the view estimates)
