		cx side 96 * + view-height 1 - cx side 96 lean - * + rail-top colour draw-clipped
		cx side 100 * + view-height 1 - cx side 100 lean - * + rail-top colour draw-clipped
		cx side 100 lean - * + rail-top cx side view-width 2 / * + 0 colour draw-clipped
