\ the cockpit below the windscreen, the type's own
: draw-panel ( -- )
	plane@type@kind to kind
	kind :hurricane = if draw-hurricane-panel exit then
	kind :lysander = if draw-lysander-panel exit then
	kind :gladiator = if draw-gladiator-panel exit then
	draw-spitfire-panel ;
